    {
      "uid": "zhcn:721cd427a3a7e1ba845058ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我゛懂゛你゛的゛啊～！　你肯定很想帮婆婆吧，小雪！\n婆婆她一直以来这么努力！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19c5f791734543879941f04e526413939d6c2b218e7c1407a123d7fd296a5b63",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
