    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c1d73f154cea9900a364387",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也要帮忙呜呜呜呜呜呜！！\n一起加油吧！！　让店里，热闹起来吧呜呜呜呜呜！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d3f8ba83a952826de12104cdb4bff179cb35118ba1f94f86c7f6f65a6d7b599",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0033/storytimeline_090033002.json",
      "json_path": [
