      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最重要的是，令人联想到如月――春天的气息的，颜色鲜艳的和果子……\n简直是一流匠人倾注心血的作品！",
      "source_fingerprint": "628acf8491d30fc81464e6d286b806989b4f1f28034c27fac7797ebc98b0cbf1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
