    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73f6176b245e87435e8c1a6a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这份『光辉』竟然要在默默无闻中消失――\n我不能接受。请让我，也献上一份力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63ab2ddecfbbc6050c3ccb0ee0a355407d9bdfcff0370036eba18f84ed34c897",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
