      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就是说嘛！　在放弃之前先要爆进！\n我这个班长也会提供协助，一定会让这家店再次复活！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74f4470f429a6b9ee0ab3fb9ac16d396eeff14fb7b1b285697b0dd096342d419",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
